  "description": "Watch now | Every week I share one public idea. This is this week's pick.",
  "body_html": "<p>Last week’s stock pick, <strong>Hexcel <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$HXL&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span></strong>, is now up <strong>14.4%</strong>. Not bad for one week.</p><p>Today’s video covers this week’s Stock of the Week.</p><p>If you’re wondering where the rest of my daily ideas come from, they’re all posted in the <em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a>.</strong></em> Every trading day I update my screener, and share any new ideas as they develop.</p><p>If that’s more than you’re looking for, no worries—I’ll keep posting one stock here each week.</p><p>Keeping this one short because everything is in the video.</p><p>Hope you’re having a good weekend. I’ll be in the <em><strong><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/89913b27-1a0a-4912-adf6-9bbd0e3345c2\">Chat</a> </strong></em>tomorrow morning before the market opens and throughout the day if anything interesting happens.</p><p>I’m off to enjoy the <strong>99° Kansas City weather... 😑</strong></p><p><strong>If you enjoyed this, a ❤️ and Restack 🔄 really helps more than you know.</strong></p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">See you all in the Chat tomorrow morning!</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div>",
